---

# Final Principle

Wall Wrestling teaches athletes that victory often comes from controlling space before controlling the opponent.

The athlete who dominates the wall,

controls posture,

applies intelligent pressure,

and maintains technical efficiency

creates opportunities that strength alone can never provide.